{"id": "EUVD-2026-102970", "enisaUuid": "a817bb33-6790-3701-ad90-ae0354360cc7", "description": "Ekko Studio through 0.7.36 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows any authenticated non-super_admin user to list and clear server-wide login lockouts via /api/auth/locked-ips. Attackers can send DELETE requests without an ip parameter to invoke unlockAll(), disabling the login rate limiter during password guessing against super_admin accounts.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T21:02:10", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/issues/3057", "https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/blob/v0.7.36/packages/server/src/modules/studio/routes/auth.ts#L26-L27", "https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/blob/v0.7.36/packages/server/src/modules/studio/controllers/auth.ts#L807-L822", "https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/commit/e65030bf26d12e1a523e773c5738af9ff61377ef", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/ekko-studio-through-0.7.36-missing-authorization-via-api-auth-locked-ips"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111679", "GHSA-rc9w-795f-h5qm"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6a1d7643-edd3-34d2-918b-fafd648d01ab", "product": {"name": "ekko-studio", "vendor": {"name": "EKKOLearnAI"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.7.36"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9e2823be-9dfd-3b91-8d18-5f97f5bc47b8", "vendor": {"name": "EKKOLearnAI"}}], "isExploited": false}